|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| EXP-1 | `H1` | Develop 3 small molecules targeting KRAS G12C with high selectivity and no cross-reactivity with HRAS or NRAS | KRAS G12C Structural Motifs | Random Sampling (method); Sotorasib (AMG 510) (prior_result) | Molecule Count/compare; Drug-likeness (QED)/maximize | d36e3d994404e957:generate_mols | kras_g12c_candidates.json (metrics_table/mcp) | `fedot_mas` |

